 ('Why should the refrigerator remain running?',['The intermittent fault may need operating data.','The warranty requires continuous commercial use.','The engineer cannot inspect any log.','Turning it off would reduce the purchase date.'],'Termsloghữụíchdiagnoseintermittentvàsupportyêucầugiữrunning.','cross-text'),
